- content_for :title, "Privacy"

- content_for :masthead do
  .container.masthead__body
    %h1.masthead__title Privacy

.container.prose
  %p We collect as little as possible.
  %ul
    %li
      When you click through to a booking or activity site we record which property and site, the dates you searched
      and the page you clicked on. We do not store your IP address or any identifier that could tell us who you are.
    %li
      We count page views on our own server, without cookies, local storage or tracking scripts, and send nothing to
      any analytics company. For each page view we keep the time, the page address without its query string, the
      name of the site you came from (only its host, such as www.google.com), any utm_source, utm_medium and
      utm_campaign values in the link, whether you used a phone or a computer, and an anonymous visitor code. The code
      is a one-way hash of your IP address and browser identification mixed with a secret that changes every day, so
      we can count visitors per day but cannot recognise you on another day or work back to your IP address. Your IP
      address and browser identification are not stored. If the site is served through a content delivery network
      that tells us the visitor's country, we keep that country too; we do not look it up ourselves.
    %li
      Requests from search engines and other automated tools are not counted, and neither are visits from browsers
      that send Do Not Track or Global Privacy Control. Page view records are deleted after
      = succeed "." do
        = pluralize(PageView.retention_days, "day")
    %li The site sets only the technically necessary session cookie. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies.
    %li
      Booking and activity sites set their own cookies once you arrive there, including to attribute your booking to us; their
      privacy policies apply. Some links pass through Stay22 on the way, which receives your IP address and the
      property and dates you chose, under its own privacy policy.
    %li
      To show prices, our server asks Stay22 for the dates and number of guests you searched. It sends nothing about you:
      no IP address, cookie or other identifier.
    %li Map tiles are loaded from the map tile server, which receives your IP address like any web server would.
